    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/tibia_tales/one_eyed_joe/protect-ears",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.tibia_tales",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.one_eyed_joe",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "protect ears"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "Protect your ears? Hmm ... Wasn't there some fabulous seafarer who used wax or something to plug his ears? There was a story about horrible bird-women or something ...? No, sounds like hogwash, doesn't it."
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/one_eyed_joe.lua:119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/tibia_tales/one_eyed_joe/story",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.tibia_tales",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.one_eyed_joe",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "yes"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "The evil I mentioned is a strange crystal, imbued with some kind of unholy energy. It is very hard to destroy, no weapon is able to shatter the thing. Maybe a jarring, very loud sound could destroy it. ...",
        "I heard of creatures, that are able to utter ear-splitting sounds. Don't remember the name, though. Would you go down there and try to destroy the crystal?"
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/one_eyed_joe.lua:122"
      ],
